2. **Neutralization of Analog Trip Injection & Sortition DoS:**
   Common-mode noise rejection and differential sensing eliminate RF/IEMI analog sensor manipulation. Even under sustained hostile physical injection, correlated events collapse into aggregated dossiers, preventing civic cognitive exhaustion.

